<title>MALAYSIA: RESEARCH ALERT - Asas Dunia starts as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Asas Dunia starts as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said it started coverage of Malaysian home builder Asas Dunia Bhd with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report released on January 15, analyst Angie Ang wrote the company was &quot;an attractive and defensive proxy for the property sector.&quot;</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our 12-month price target is 12.50 ringgit per share, representing a return of 46 percent over the current share price.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
